text = "Interface for defining sequences of [color=D9FF00]input clock pin[/color] activations. Click the [b]+[/b] button to add a new sequence. Selecing an [color=D9FF00]input clock pin[/color] makes an entry for it appear, with checkboxes to define which cycle it should activate in.
Click the play button next to the sequence's name to start it. (Clock steps are still controlled via normal means)"
fit_content = true
autowrap_mode = 2

